@startuml autonomous-offering-operations-boundary
title Autonomous Offering / Autonomous Operations Boundary ; per ADR-ES-019 section 12

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Autonomous Offering" as AO
class "Autonomous Operations" as AOp

AO --> AOp : may depend upon

note right
  Per ADR-ES-019 section 12 + AOFF-AUTO-NEG-004:
  - Autonomous Operations represents the operating environment
  - Autonomous Operations is NOT a subtype of Offering
  - Autonomous Offering is NOT Autonomous Operations
end note

@enduml
